E8533 `orders`: `type="json2"` takes its parameters from a program without declaring them
 --> controllers_typed.py:7:5
  |
5 | class Api(http.Controller):
6 |     @http.route("/api/orders", type="json2", auth="user")
7 |     def orders(self, limit):  # E8533: not typed
  |     ^^^^^^^^^^
8 |         return []
  |
help: Declare `typed=True` and annotate every parameter

E8533 `hook`: `auth="bearer"` is typed but note, flag carries no annotation
  --> controllers_typed.py:11:5
   |
10 |     @route("/api/hook", auth="bearer", typed=True)
11 |     def hook(self, order_id: int, note, *, flag):  # E8533: two parameters undeclared
   |     ^^^^^^^^
12 |         return []
   |
help: Annotate every parameter

E8533 `twice`: `type="json2"` takes its parameters from a program without declaring them
